    "en": {
      "trackName": "Games in One: Watch",
      "description": "Games in One is a collection of mini games designed for Apple Watch.\n\nJump into puzzles, arcade challenges, action games, and casual games right from your wrist. Each game is built for short sessions—perfect at home, on your commute, while waiting in line, or during a quick break.\n\nWHAT'S INSIDE\n\n• 2048 number puzzles\n• Fruit merge games\n• Sorting puzzle games\n• Stack building games\n• Arcade bird challenges\n• Sports and dunk games\n• Reaction and reflex games\n• Casual arcade games\n\nFEATURES\n\n• Mini-game collection for Apple Watch\n• Puzzle, arcade, action, and casual gameplay\n• Controls optimized for the small screen\n• Fast to start, easy to play\n• Made for watchOS\n• More games and content to come\n\nWhether you like number puzzles, merge games, sorting challenges, arcade classics, or quick reflex games, Games in One brings a growing collection of Apple Watch games to your wrist.",
